    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ieThis beautifully presented semi-detached home (R93 W3W5) commands an elevated site adjacent to the entrance to Brotherton, offering excellent immediate access to main roads, shop, public transport, sporting facilities and all town amenities. The residence was constructed in 2005 as part of a small private development on the edge of town and presents 110msq of quality accommodation over two floors. Rooms are generously proportioned, all bedrooms are double rooms, while every modern convenience is afforded. Hardwood flooring, quality fixtures and fittings, and its bright airy interior are sure to appeal. Externally, multi off street parking to its front is cobbled, while a secure side gate accesses a fully fenced rear garden. With mains services, gas fired central heating, a climate control system, and a solid fuel fireplace, total comfort is assured. Viewings are highly recommended and invited on a strictly appointment basis."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 4.38m x 2.21m\nuPVChall door with glazed panels. Solid oak timber floor. Carpeted stairs. Storage press beneath.\n\nLounge - 5.47m x 3.82m\nFeature bay windows to front. Curtains and pole. Solid oak timber floor. Solid fuel fireplace with gas fire unit.\n\nKitchen/ Dining Area - 4.48m x 3.71m\nDouble french doors and window to rear. Ceramic tiled floor. Fully fitted floor and wall units. Electric oven, ceramic hob and extractor fan. Fridge, freezer and dish washer. Utility room off.\n\nUtility Room - 2.01m x 1.54m\nWindow to side. Ceramic tiled floor. Floor of wall storage units. Plumbing for utility machines. Wall mounted gas burner. W.C. off.\n\nW.C. - 1.56m x 1.54m\nCeramic tiled floor. Window to rear. Toilet and sink. Storage unit.\n\nLaundry - 3.33m x 2.72m\nSolid oak timber floor. Attic access hatch. Hot press off.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.00m x 2.74m\nDouble room. Window to rear. Curtains and pole. Solid oak timber floor. Built in wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.97m x 3.07m\nDouble room, window to rear. Curtains and pole. Solid oak timber floor. Built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.83m x 3.58m\nMaster room. Window to front. Curtains and pole. Solid oak timber floor. Built in wardrobe and desk. En-suite off.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.15m x 1.51m\nWindow to side with blinds. Ceramic tiled floor. Part-tiled walls. Toilet, sink and shower cubicle. Wall mirror and shaving light. Extractor fan.\n\nBathroom - 2.45m x 2.23m\nWindow to front. Blinds. Ceramic tiled floor. Part tiled walls. Toilet, sink, bath. Electric pump shower above bath. Shower screen. Extractor fan. Wall mirror and shaving light.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>3-Bed-3-Bath</li><li>Gas fired central heating</li><li>Solid fuel fireplace</li><li>Climate control system</li><li>uPVC double glazing</li><li>Off-street parking</li><li>Excellent accessibility</ul>"
      },
